{
  "info": {
    "name": "Banco XYZ — Plataforma",
    "description": "Colección de pruebas manuales (ver instrucciones.md). Variables en el entorno `banco-xyz.postman_environment.json`. Sin secretos: complételos desde su `.env`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Tokens (auth-server)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token interno (client_credentials, scope internal)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{auth}}/oauth2/token",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "internal-service",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{internal_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials"
                },
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "internal"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const t = pm.response.json().access_token;",
                  "pm.environment.set('internal_token', t);",
                  "pm.test('token obtenido', () => pm.expect(t).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Token ATM (client_credentials, scope atm:operate)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{auth}}/oauth2/token",
            "auth": {
              "type": "basic",
              "basic": [
                {
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "atm-client",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "{{atm_secret}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "client_credentials"
                },
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "atm:operate"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const t = pm.response.json().access_token;",
                  "pm.environment.set('atm_token', t);",
                  "pm.test('token obtenido', () => pm.expect(t).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Los tokens web y móvil usan Authorization Code + PKCE: obténgalos con `scripts/token.sh web|mobile customer1` y péguelos en `mobile_token`."
    },
    {
      "name": "1 · API Gateway → microservicios (token interno)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/customers",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"documentNumber\": \"12345678-5\",\n  \"firstName\": \"Camila\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Rojas\",\n  \"email\": \"camila@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+56912345678\",\n  \"username\": \"customer1\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('customer_id', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil del cliente",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/customers/{{customer_id}}/profile",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Abrir cuenta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/accounts",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"customerId\": \"{{customer_id}}\",\n  \"type\": \"CHECKING\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('account_id', pm.response.json().id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Saldo",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/accounts/{{account_id}}/balance",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Depósito (202, saga asíncrona)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/payments/deposit",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"toAccountId\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": 10000\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('payment_id', pm.response.json().paymentId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Estado del pago",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/payments/{{payment_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Movimientos de la cuenta",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/accounts/{{account_id}}/movements?limit=5",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2 · Batch (requiere token con rol BATCH_ADMIN)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Lanzar dailyTransactionReportJob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/batch/jobs/dailyTransactionReportJob",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"runId\": \"postman-1\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{batch_admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('execution_id', pm.response.json().executionId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Lanzar monthlyInterestJob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/batch/jobs/monthlyInterestJob",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"runId\": \"postman-1\",\n    \"periodo\": \"MENSUAL\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{batch_admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Lanzar annualStatementJob",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/batch/jobs/annualStatementJob",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"runId\": \"postman-1\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{batch_admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Estado de una ejecución",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/batch/executions/{{execution_id}}",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{batch_admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Rechazados de una ejecución",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{gateway}}/api/batch/executions/{{execution_id}}/rejected?limit=10",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{batch_admin_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "`batch_admin_token` = `scripts/token.sh web batch-admin`."
    },
    {
      "name": "3 · BFF móvil (token mobile:*)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Home (saldo total + cuentas)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{bff_mobile}}/mobile/home",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mobile_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cuentas con campos parciales",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{bff_mobile}}/mobile/accounts?fields=number,balance",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mobile_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token ATM contra BFF móvil → 403 (seguridad por canal)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{bff_mobile}}/mobile/home",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{atm_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Transferencia (Idempotency-Key obligatoria)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_mobile}}/mobile/transfers",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"from\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n  \"to\": \"{{account_id_2}}\",\n  \"amount\": 1000,\n  \"note\": \"demo\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mobile_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4 · BFF ATM (mTLS + token atm:operate)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Emitir tarjeta simulada (token interno)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_atm}}/atm/internal/cards",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardId\": \"40001234567890\",\n  \"accountId\": \"{{account_id}}\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{internal_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Saldo",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_atm}}/atm/balance",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardId\": \"40001234567890\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{atm_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Últimos 5 movimientos",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_atm}}/atm/movements",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardId\": \"40001234567890\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{atm_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Retiro (Idempotency-Key obligatoria; dispense=true solo si está confirmado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Idempotency-Key",
                "value": "{{$guid}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_atm}}/atm/withdrawals",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardId\": \"40001234567890\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\",\n  \"amount\": 20000\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{atm_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Token móvil contra BFF ATM → 403",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{bff_atm}}/atm/balance",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"cardId\": \"40001234567890\",\n  \"pin\": \"1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{mobile_token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Configure en Postman → Settings → Certificates: CA = certs/out/ca.crt y un certificado de cliente para localhost:8445 (CRT = certs/out/atm-0001.crt, KEY = certs/out/atm-0001.key). Sin certificado de cliente el handshake TLS falla (es lo esperado)."
    },
    {
      "name": "5 · BFF web (sesión con cookie)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "¿Quién soy? (requiere sesión)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{bff_web}}/web/me"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Dashboard agregado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{bff_web}}/web/dashboard?movements=5"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "El BFF web no usa Bearer: abra https://localhost:8443/oauth2/authorization/web-client en el navegador (usuario customer1), o use el *Postman Interceptor* para compartir la cookie BFFWEB_SESSION. Las escrituras exigen la cabecera X-XSRF-TOKEN."
    }
  ]
}